<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">5.</FONT>&nbsp;<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><U>Company
Representations and Warranties</U>. For purposes of this Section&nbsp;5, with respect to the Subscription Closing, the term &ldquo;Company&rdquo;
