<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">d.</FONT>&nbsp;<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The
Shares are not, and following the Transaction Closing and each Closing Date will not be, subject to any Transfer Restriction. The term
 &ldquo;<U>Transfer Restriction</U>&rdquo; means any condition to or restriction on the ability of the Subscriber to pledge, sell, assign
