Agreement or the Transaction Agreement, or materially affect the validity of the Shares or the legal authority or ability of the Company
to comply in all material respects with the terms of this Subscription Agreement (a &ldquo;<U>Material Adverse Effect</U>&rdquo;); (ii)&nbsp;result
in any violation of the provisions of the organizational documents of the Company; or (iii)&nbsp;result in any violation of any statute
or any judgment, order, rule&nbsp;or regulation of any court or governmental agency, taxing authority or regulatory body, domestic or
foreign, having jurisdiction over the Company or any of its properties that would reasonably be expected to have a Material Adverse Effect.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">g.</FONT>&nbsp;<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Assuming
the accuracy of the representations and warranties of the Subscriber set forth in Section&nbsp;6 of this Subscription Agreement, the
