reasonably be expected to have a Material Adverse Effect or have a material adverse effect on the Company&rsquo;s ability to
consummate the transactions contemplated hereby, including the issuance and sale of the Shares.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

