accounting requirements and the rules&nbsp;and regulations of the Commission with respect thereto as in effect at the time of filing
and fairly present in all material respects the financial position of the Company as of and for the dates thereof and the results of
operations and cash flows for the periods then ended, subject, in the case of unaudited statements, to normal, year-end audit
