<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">o.</FONT>&nbsp;<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The
Subscriber, its affiliates, their agents, and any other persons acting on their behalf is not (i)&nbsp;a person or entity named on
the OFAC List, or a person or entity prohibited by any OFAC sanctions program, (ii)&nbsp;is not owned, controlled, or acting on
behalf of a person or entity prohibited by any OFAC sanctions program, (iii)&nbsp;located, operating, or resident in any country or
territory subject to comprehensive sanctions (currently, the Crimea, the so-called Donetsk People&rsquo;s Republic, and the
