<TD STYLE="width: 10.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">p.</FONT></TD><TD>Subscriber will have sufficient funds to pay the Purchase Price at the Subscription Closing.</TD></TR></TABLE>

