    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; padding: 0.25pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&uml; We are an &ldquo;accredited investor&rdquo; (within the meaning of Rule&nbsp;501(a)&nbsp;under the Securities Act or an entity in which all of the equity holders are accredited investors within the meaning of Rule&nbsp;501(a)&nbsp;under the Securities Act), and have&nbsp;<B><I>marked and initialed the appropriate box on the following pages</I></B>&nbsp;indicating the provision under which we qualify as an &ldquo;accredited investor.&rdquo;</FONT></TD></TR>
